#: ../../library/machine.LED.rst:5
msgid "class LED -- portable on-board LED control"
msgstr "klasa LED -- prijenosno upravljanje LED diodama na ploči"

#: ../../library/machine.LED.rst:7
msgid ""
"The :class:`LED` class is a thin portable wrapper around "
":class:`machine.Pin` that drives a named board LED, hiding the active-low / "
"active-high wiring difference between boards. It is shipped as a frozen "
"Python module by the OpenMV firmware (see ``scripts/libraries/machine.py``) "
"and is therefore available on every OpenMV-supported board, regardless of "
"port."
msgstr ""
"Klasa :class:`LED` je tanak, prijenosan omotač oko :class:`machine.Pin` koji"
" upravlja imenovanom LED diodom na ploči, skrivajući razliku u ožičenju "
"active-low / active-high između ploča. Isporučuje se kao zamrznuti Python "
"modul od strane OpenMV firmwarea (vidi ``scripts/libraries/machine.py``\\ ) "
"i stoga je dostupan na svakoj ploči koju OpenMV podržava, neovisno o portu."

#: ../../library/machine.LED.rst:14
msgid ""
"The LED is driven as a simple on/off GPIO; there is no PWM intensity "
"control. For LEDs wired to PWM-capable pins drive them via :class:`PWM` "
"directly instead."
msgstr ""
"LED dioda se upravlja kao jednostavan uključi/isključi GPIO; ne postoji PWM "
"kontrola intenziteta. Za LED diode ožičene na pinove koji podržavaju PWM "
"upravljajte njima izravno putem :class:`PWM`\\ ."

#: ../../library/machine.LED.rst:18
msgid "Example usage::"
msgstr "Primjer korištenja::"

#: ../../library/machine.LED.rst:28
msgid "Constructors"
msgstr "Konstruktori"

#: ../../library/machine.LED.rst:32
msgid ""
"Construct an :class:`LED` object bound to the LED identified by "
"``pin_name``. ``pin_name`` is either an OpenMV-board LED string "
"(``\"LED_RED\"``, ``\"LED_GREEN\"``, ``\"LED_BLUE\"``, ``\"LED_IR\"`` -- the"
" exact set depends on the cam) or a :class:`Pin` object."
msgstr ""
"Konstruira :class:`LED` objekt povezan s LED diodom identificiranom pomoću "
"``pin_name``\\ . ``pin_name`` je ili niz LED diode OpenMV ploče (\\ "
"``\"LED_RED\"``\\ , ``\"LED_GREEN\"``\\ , ``\"LED_BLUE\"``\\ , "
"``\"LED_IR\"`` -- točan skup ovisi o kameri) ili :class:`Pin` objekt."

#: ../../library/machine.LED.rst:37
msgid ""
"The constructor records whether the LED is wired active-low or active-high "
"(using :meth:`boardname` to look up the active-level convention for the "
"current board) so callers always pass logical on/off levels without worrying"
" about polarity."
msgstr ""
"Konstruktor bilježi je li LED dioda ožičena kao active-low ili active-high "
"(koristeći :meth:`boardname` za pronalaženje konvencije aktivne razine za "
"trenutnu ploču) tako da pozivatelji uvijek prosljeđuju logičke razine "
"uključeno/isključeno bez brige o polaritetu."

#: ../../library/machine.LED.rst:43
msgid "Methods"
msgstr "Metode"

#: ../../library/machine.LED.rst:47
msgid "Drive the LED to its on state."
msgstr "Postavlja LED diodu u uključeno stanje."

#: ../../library/machine.LED.rst:51
msgid "Drive the LED to its off state."
msgstr "Postavlja LED diodu u isključeno stanje."

#: ../../library/machine.LED.rst:55
msgid "Flip the LED's current state."
msgstr "Mijenja trenutno stanje LED diode."

#: ../../library/machine.LED.rst:59
msgid "Get or set the LED state."
msgstr "Dohvaća ili postavlja stanje LED diode."

#: ../../library/machine.LED.rst:61
msgid ""
"With no argument, return the current logical state (``0`` = off, ``1`` = "
"on)."
msgstr ""
"Bez argumenta vraća trenutno logičko stanje (\\ ``0`` = isključeno, ``1`` = "
"uključeno)."

#: ../../library/machine.LED.rst:64
msgid ""
"With a single ``v`` argument, set the LED to that state. The driver XORs "
"``v`` with the board's active-level convention so ``1`` is always \"on\" "
"regardless of polarity."
msgstr ""
"S jednim argumentom ``v`` postavlja LED diodu u to stanje. Upravljački "
"program primjenjuje XOR na ``v`` s konvencijom aktivne razine ploče, tako da"
" ``1`` uvijek znači \"uključeno\" neovisno o polaritetu."

#: ../../library/machine.LED.rst:70
msgid ""
"Return the board name string (the prefix of ``os.uname().machine`` before "
"``\" with \"``). Used internally to pick the right active-level convention "
"for the LED."
msgstr ""
"Vraća niz s imenom ploče (prefiks ``os.uname().machine`` prije ``\" with "
"\"``\\ ). Koristi se interno za odabir ispravne konvencije aktivne razine za"
" LED diodu."
